From 0798d991ab2d652e54682750acb4fdd9f1e6d9ac Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: vince <vincepaul.liem@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 13:21:46 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] feat(launch): execute owned scripts through bounded
 interpreter chains

Resolve up to four owned scripts to an owned ELF or permitted image
interpreter. Preserve virtual names and optional arguments on the new
exec stack; reopen public owned descriptor names with fresh offsets.
Keep pin and private backing cleanup with the existing exec transaction.

Signed-off-by: vince <vincepaul.liem@gmail.com>
